    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umusi umwe, Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Ni jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yatumye kukurobanuza amavuta ngo ube umwami w’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli; niwumve rero ijambo ngiye kukubwira rivuye k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ngomba guhana Abamaleki kubera ivyo bakoreye Abisirayeli igihe babategera mu nzira bavuye muri Egiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero genda utere Abamaleki kandi urandure ikintu cose. Ntihagire ico usigaza; wice abagabo n’abagore, abana n’inzoya, inka n’intama, ingamiya n’indogoba.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sawuli atumako abagize ingabo bose, abakoraniriza i Telayimu, bose hamwe bari abasoda ibihumbi amajana abiri bavuye mu miryango ya Isirayeli hamwe n’ibihumbi cumi bavuye mu muryango wa Yuda wonyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sawuli ajana n’ingabo ziwe gutera igisagara c’Abamaleki, binyegeza mu mwonga kugira ngo babatere giturumbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abwira Abakayini ati: “Mwebwe nimwitandukanye n’Abamaleki kugira ngo ntimuranduranwe na bo; kuko mwagiriye neza Abisirayeli igihe bava muri Egiputa.” Nuko Abakayini bitandukanya n’Abamaleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Sawuli atera Abamaleki kuva i Havila gushika i Shuri, mu buseruko bwa Egiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afata Agagi umwami w’Abamaleki, abantu biwe bose abaranduza inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Sawuli n’ingabo ziwe basigaza Agagi n’ibitungwa vyizavyiza vyo mu ntama n’inka, inyana zivyibushe n’imyagazi y’intama, eka ibintu vyose vyiza, ibikengeretse n’ibinyantegenke vyose baba ari vyo barandura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abwira Samweli ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndicujije icatumye nimika Sawuli ngo abe umwami, kuko yanteye ibitugu ntakurikize ivyo namutegetse.” Samweli arababara cane, atakambira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " iryo joro ryose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gitondo ca kare Samweli aravyuka aja kubonana na Sawuli, ariko baramubwira bati: “Sawuli yagiye i Karumeli gushinga icibutso ciwe co kumuhesha icubahiro hanyuma aca aramanuka aja i Gilugali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli amushikiriye, Sawuli amubwira ati: “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aguhezagire! Ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yantegetse gukora vyose, nabikoze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli aramwishura ati: “None ko numva ukwabira kw’intama n’inka mu matwi yanje?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Ni intama n’inka nziza kurusha izindi abasoda basigaje barabizana babikuye mu Bamaleki kugira ngo babishikanire ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yawe, ariko ibindi vyose twarabiranduye turabimara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Geza aho! Nyumviriza nkubwire ico ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yaraye ambwiye muri iri joro rikeye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Mbwira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli amubwira ati: “Naho wewe nyene wari wariravye ukikengera, mbega ntiwabaye umurongozi w’imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yarakurobanuje amavuta ngo ube umwami w’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaragutumye, arakubwira ati: ‘Genda urandure abo bantu babi b’Abamaleki, ubagwanye gushika ubamaze bose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None ni iki catumye utumvira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? Ni kuki wagurukiye ku vyanyazwe ugakora ikintu kibi nk’ico mu nyonga z’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
